<title>USA: MYR Group backlog rises.</title>
<headline>MYR Group backlog rises.</headline>
<dateline>ROLLING MEADOWS, Ill. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>MYR Group Inc, which provides electric and telecommunications construction services, said its backlog rose 67.9 percent to $124.9 million as of September 30, compared to $74.4 million last year.</p>
<p>Substantially all the current backlog will be completed within 12 months, it added.</p>
<p>Earlier, MYR reported third quarter primary earnings of $0.44 a share, up from $0.37 last year.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
